{
  "unit": "u15-describing",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "dekhte-looks",
      "bn": "দেখতে",
      "tr": "dekhte",
      "en": "in looks",
      "alt": [
        "looks",
        "to look at"
      ],
      "pos": "adv",
      "lesson": "u15-l01",
      "notes": "ও দেখতে লম্বা 'he looks tall; he is tall (to look at)'. ও দেখতে কেমন? 'What does she look like?' The same form is 'to see' after a verb of motion (U11: দেখতে যাব)."
    },
    {
